{"page":188,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:7","surah":9,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"كَيْفَ يَكُونُ لِلْمُشْرِكِينَ عَهْدٌ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ وَعِندَ رَسُولِهِۦٓ إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ عَـٰهَدتُّمْ عِندَ ٱلْمَسْجِدِ ٱلْحَرَامِ ۖ فَمَا ٱسْتَقَـٰمُوا۟ لَكُمْ فَٱسْتَقِيمُوا۟ لَهُمْ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُحِبُّ ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"How could there be a treaty with God and His Messenger for such idolaters? But as for those with whom you made a treaty at the Sacred Mosque, so long as they remain true to you, be true to them; God loves those who are mindful of Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كَيْفَ","en_gloss":"How","transliteration":"kayfa","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَكُونُ","en_gloss":"can (there) be","transliteration":"yakūnu","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_gloss":"for the polytheists","transliteration":"lil'mush'rikīna","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَهْدٌ","en_gloss":"a covenant","transliteration":"ʿahdun","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَعِندَ","en_gloss":"and with","transliteration":"waʿinda","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"رَسُولِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"His Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlihi","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those (with) whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَـٰهَدتُّمْ","en_gloss":"you made a covenant","transliteration":"ʿāhadttum","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"near","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْمَسْجِدِ","en_gloss":"Al-Masjid","transliteration":"l-masjidi","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْحَرَامِ ۖ","en_gloss":"Al-Haraam","transliteration":"l-ḥarāmi","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"So long as","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱسْتَقَـٰمُوا۟","en_gloss":"they are upright","transliteration":"is'taqāmū","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فَٱسْتَقِيمُوا۟","en_gloss":"then you be upright","transliteration":"fa-is'taqīmū","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":19,"ar":"لَهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":20,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":22,"ar":"يُحِبُّ","en_gloss":"loves","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":23,"ar":"ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_gloss":"the righteous","transliteration":"l-mutaqīna","verse_key":"9:7"},{"pos":24,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:7"}]},{"verse_key":"9:8","surah":9,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"كَيْفَ وَإِن يَظْهَرُوا۟ عَلَيْكُمْ لَا يَرْقُبُوا۟ فِيكُمْ إِلًّا وَلَا ذِمَّةً ۚ يُرْضُونَكُم بِأَفْوَٰهِهِمْ وَتَأْبَىٰ قُلُوبُهُمْ وَأَكْثَرُهُمْ فَـٰسِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[How,] when, if they were to get the upper hand over you, they would not respect any tie with you, of kinship or of treaty? They please you with their tongues, but their hearts are against you and most of them are lawbreakers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كَيْفَ","en_gloss":"How","transliteration":"kayfa","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"while, if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَظْهَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they gain dominance","transliteration":"yaẓharū","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"over you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"they do not regard (the ties)","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَرْقُبُوا۟","en_gloss":"they do not regard (the ties)","transliteration":"yarqubū","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"with you","transliteration":"fīkum","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلًّۭا","en_gloss":"(of) kinship","transliteration":"illan","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ذِمَّةًۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"covenant of protection","transliteration":"dhimmatan","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُرْضُونَكُم","en_gloss":"They satisfy you","transliteration":"yur'ḍūnakum","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِأَفْوَٰهِهِمْ","en_gloss":"with their mouths","transliteration":"bi-afwāhihim","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَتَأْبَىٰ","en_gloss":"but refuse","transliteration":"watabā","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قُلُوبُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbuhum","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَأَكْثَرُهُمْ","en_gloss":"and most of them","transliteration":"wa-aktharuhum","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَـٰسِقُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) defiantly disobedient","transliteration":"fāsiqūna","verse_key":"9:8"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٨","en_gloss":"(8)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:8"}]},{"verse_key":"9:9","surah":9,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"ٱشْتَرَوْا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ ثَمَنًا قَلِيلًا فَصَدُّوا۟ عَن سَبِيلِهِۦٓ ۚ إِنَّهُمْ سَآءَ مَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They have sold God’s message for a trifling gain, and barred others from His path. How evil their actions are!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱشْتَرَوْا۟","en_gloss":"They exchange","transliteration":"ish'taraw","verse_key":"9:9"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"[with] the Verses of Allah","transliteration":"biāyāti","verse_key":"9:9"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"[with] the Verses of Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:9"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ثَمَنًۭا","en_gloss":"(for) a little price","transliteration":"thamanan","verse_key":"9:9"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَلِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"(for) a little price","transliteration":"qalīlan","verse_key":"9:9"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَصَدُّوا۟","en_gloss":"and they hinder (people)","transliteration":"faṣaddū","verse_key":"9:9"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"9:9"},{"pos":8,"ar":"سَبِيلِهِۦٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"His way","transliteration":"sabīlihi","verse_key":"9:9"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"innahum","verse_key":"9:9"},{"pos":10,"ar":"سَآءَ","en_gloss":"evil","transliteration":"sāa","verse_key":"9:9"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(is) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:9"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"9:9"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"do","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","verse_key":"9:9"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٩","en_gloss":"(9)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:9"}]},{"verse_key":"9:10","surah":9,"ayah":10,"ar_uthmani":"لَا يَرْقُبُونَ فِى مُؤْمِنٍ إِلًّا وَلَا ذِمَّةً ۚ وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْمُعْتَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Where believers are concerned, they respect no tie of kinship or treaty. They are the ones who are committing aggression.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:10"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرْقُبُونَ","en_gloss":"they respect (the ties)","transliteration":"yarqubūna","verse_key":"9:10"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"towards","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:10"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مُؤْمِنٍ","en_gloss":"a believer","transliteration":"mu'minin","verse_key":"9:10"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلًّۭا","en_gloss":"(of) kinship","transliteration":"illan","verse_key":"9:10"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"9:10"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ذِمَّةًۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"covenant of protection","transliteration":"dhimmatan","verse_key":"9:10"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"And those","transliteration":"wa-ulāika","verse_key":"9:10"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"[they]","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"9:10"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْمُعْتَدُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) the transgressors","transliteration":"l-muʿ'tadūna","verse_key":"9:10"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٠","en_gloss":"(10)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:10"}]},{"verse_key":"9:11","surah":9,"ayah":11,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِن تَابُوا۟ وَأَقَامُوا۟ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَءَاتَوُا۟ ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ فَإِخْوَٰنُكُمْ فِى ٱلدِّينِ ۗ وَنُفَصِّلُ ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ لِقَوْمٍ يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If they turn to God, keep up the prayer, and pay the prescribed alms, then they are your brothers in faith: We make the messages clear for people who are willing to learn.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"9:11"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَابُوا۟","en_gloss":"they repent","transliteration":"tābū","verse_key":"9:11"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَأَقَامُوا۟","en_gloss":"and establish","transliteration":"wa-aqāmū","verse_key":"9:11"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","verse_key":"9:11"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَءَاتَوُا۟","en_gloss":"and give","transliteration":"waātawū","verse_key":"9:11"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"the zakah","transliteration":"l-zakata","verse_key":"9:11"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَإِخْوَٰنُكُمْ","en_gloss":"then (they are) your brothers","transliteration":"fa-ikh'wānukum","verse_key":"9:11"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:11"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلدِّينِ ۗ","en_gloss":"[the] religion","transliteration":"l-dīni","verse_key":"9:11"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَنُفَصِّلُ","en_gloss":"And We explain in detail","transliteration":"wanufaṣṣilu","verse_key":"9:11"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the Verses","transliteration":"l-āyāti","verse_key":"9:11"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِقَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a people","transliteration":"liqawmin","verse_key":"9:11"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"(who) know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"9:11"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١١","en_gloss":"(11)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:11"}]},{"verse_key":"9:12","surah":9,"ayah":12,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِن نَّكَثُوٓا۟ أَيْمَـٰنَهُم مِّنۢ بَعْدِ عَهْدِهِمْ وَطَعَنُوا۟ فِى دِينِكُمْ فَقَـٰتِلُوٓا۟ أَئِمَّةَ ٱلْكُفْرِ ۙ إِنَّهُمْ لَآ أَيْمَـٰنَ لَهُمْ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَنتَهُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But if they break their oath after having made an agreement with you, if they revile your religion, then fight the leaders of disbelief- oaths mean nothing to them- so that they may stop.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَّكَثُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they break","transliteration":"nakathū","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنَهُم","en_gloss":"their oaths","transliteration":"aymānahum","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَهْدِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their treaty","transliteration":"ʿahdihim","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَطَعَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"and defame","transliteration":"waṭaʿanū","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"[in]","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":9,"ar":"دِينِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your religion","transliteration":"dīnikum","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَقَـٰتِلُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"then fight","transliteration":"faqātilū","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَئِمَّةَ","en_gloss":"the leaders","transliteration":"a-immata","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْكُفْرِ ۙ","en_gloss":"(of) [the] disbelief","transliteration":"l-kuf'ri","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"indeed, they ","transliteration":"innahum","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"oaths","transliteration":"aymāna","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may","transliteration":"laʿallahum","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يَنتَهُونَ","en_gloss":"cease","transliteration":"yantahūna","verse_key":"9:12"},{"pos":19,"ar":"١٢","en_gloss":"(12)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:12"}]},{"verse_key":"9:13","surah":9,"ayah":13,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَا تُقَـٰتِلُونَ قَوْمًا نَّكَثُوٓا۟ أَيْمَـٰنَهُمْ وَهَمُّوا۟ بِإِخْرَاجِ ٱلرَّسُولِ وَهُم بَدَءُوكُمْ أَوَّلَ مَرَّةٍ ۚ أَتَخْشَوْنَهُمْ ۚ فَٱللَّهُ أَحَقُّ أَن تَخْشَوْهُ إِن كُنتُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"How could you not fight a people who have broken their oaths, who tried to drive the Messenger out, who attacked you first? Do you fear them? It is God you should fear if you are true believers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَا","en_gloss":"Will not","transliteration":"alā","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُقَـٰتِلُونَ","en_gloss":"you fight","transliteration":"tuqātilūna","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَوْمًۭا","en_gloss":"a people","transliteration":"qawman","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَّكَثُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"who broke","transliteration":"nakathū","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their oaths","transliteration":"aymānahum","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَهَمُّوا۟","en_gloss":"and determined","transliteration":"wahammū","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِإِخْرَاجِ","en_gloss":"to drive out","transliteration":"bi-ikh'rāji","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولِ","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūli","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَهُم","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بَدَءُوكُمْ","en_gloss":"began (to attack) you","transliteration":"badaūkum","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَوَّلَ","en_gloss":"first","transliteration":"awwala","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَرَّةٍ ۚ","en_gloss":"time","transliteration":"marratin","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَتَخْشَوْنَهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"Do you fear them","transliteration":"atakhshawnahum","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"But Allah","transliteration":"fal-lahu","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَحَقُّ","en_gloss":"(has) more right","transliteration":"aḥaqqu","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":17,"ar":"تَخْشَوْهُ","en_gloss":"you should fear Him","transliteration":"takhshawhu","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":19,"ar":"كُنتُم","en_gloss":"you are","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مُّؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"believers","transliteration":"mu'minīna","verse_key":"9:13"},{"pos":21,"ar":"١٣","en_gloss":"(13)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:13"}]}]}